3. Add your Google OAuth credentials
4. Add authorized redirect URLs:
   - Development: `http://localhost:3000/dashboard`
   - Production: `https://yourdomain.com/dashboard`

### 5. Install & Run

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Visit http://localhost:3000

